  "description": "<h1>KappaMarker</h1>\n<p>A very simple mod that marks quests required for the Collector.<br />\nIt adds “Required for Kappa” to quest descriptions and a “[K]” prefix to quest names.\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VX3NUg1.png\" alt=\"Showcase\" /></p>\n<h1>Installation</h1>\n<ol>\n<li>Download the mod.</li>\n<li>⬇️\n<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/34vXXDj.gif\" alt=\"Installation\" /></li>\n</ol>\n<p>Alternatively, you can find the 3.10.5 version on GitHub. I haven’t tested it, but it should work on LTS 3.11 too.</p>\n",
